Subject: [Description]:Introduces InterfaceType in Host DM and refines Layer1Interface resolution with Ethernet interface mapping/VLAN extraction.Also normalizes VLAN defaulting (-1) and updates host string/int parameter index layout accordingly.
[RCA/Root Cause Analysis]:
Prior model mixed physical interface naming and type semantics, and VLAN/interface reporting was inconsistent.
Static/legacy assignment logic could misreport Ethernet sub-interfaces and lacked clean InterfaceType exposure.

[Fix Description]:
Added InterfaceType to XML, DML getter path, host structure, and string-parameter metadata indices.
Added FDB parser (get_interface_from_fdb) to resolve base interface + VLAN ID and populate Host fields accurately.

Signed-off-by: Hanna Jose <hjose@qti.qualcomm.com>
